{
  "model": "portfolio.project",
  "pk": 9,
  "fields": {
    "title": "CardFlow",
    "slug": "cardflow",
    "description": "Production ID card management platform built for schools and organizations, covering data management, automated workflows, card generation and cross-platform operations.",
    "project_name": "CardFlow",
    "documentation": "<h3>Overview</h3>\n<p>CardFlow is a production ID-card management platform built to handle enterprise identity workflows, data ingestion, student/staff record processing, and automated print-ready card generation. Currently used by over 1,000 active users in schools and organizations.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Architectural Highlights</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Data Ingestion & Pipelines:</strong> Robust validation for CSV/Excel data uploads with duplicate detection and real-time error reporting.</li>\n  <li><strong>Automated Card Generation:</strong> High-throughput server-side rendering producing high-DPI print-ready cards with barcodes and QR verification.</li>\n  <li><strong>Role-Based Access Control (RBAC):</strong> Granular permissions for Superadmins, School Administrators, and Operators.</li>\n  <li><strong>Background Job Processing:</strong> Celery + Redis workers handle heavy batch card rendering asynchronously without blocking the user interface.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Technical Stack</h3>\n<p>Django, Django REST Framework, React, PostgreSQL, Redis, Celery, Docker, Nginx.</p>",
    "category": 19,
    "technologies": "Django, React, PostgreSQL, Redis, Celery",
    "github_url": "https://github.com/logicbyroshan/cardfloww-idcard-management-saas.git",
    "live_url": "https://logicbyroshan.in/#projects",
    "demo_url": "https://logicbyroshan.in/#projects",
    "other_url": null,
    "thumbnail": "",
    "start_date": null,
    "end_date": null,
