{
  "model": "portfolio.project",
  "pk": 10,
  "fields": {
    "title": "VidyaMaxx",
    "slug": "vidyamaxx",
    "description": "AI-integrated school management platform bringing academics, administration, communication and school operations into one system.",
    "project_name": "VidyaMaxx",
    "documentation": "<h3>Overview</h3>\n<p>VidyaMaxx is a next-generation school management platform currently undergoing pilot testing with selected partner schools. It unifies administrative operations, grading, attendance tracking, and student communication with intelligent AI workflows.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Architectural Highlights</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Academic Operations Hub:</strong> Centralized management of schedules, attendance records, exam grade calculations, and transcript generation.</li>\n  <li><strong>AI-Assisted Insights:</strong> Machine learning models analyze student progress patterns, alerting educators to students needing academic intervention.</li>\n  <li><strong>Multi-Tenant Architecture:</strong> Isolated data tenancy per school organization ensuring strict FERPA-compliant privacy and data security.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Technical Stack</h3>\n<p>Django, React, PostgreSQL, Redis, Python AI Services, Tailwind CSS.</p>",
    "category": 20,
    "technologies": "Django, React, PostgreSQL, Redis, AI",
    "github_url": "https://github.com/logicbyroshan/vidyamaxx-school-management-saas.git",
