{
  "model": "portfolio.project",
  "pk": 11,
  "fields": {
    "title": "PrintNexx",
    "slug": "printnexx",
    "description": "Internal image-processing and card-generation tool built to automate photo preparation, image finishing and ID card generation workflows.",
    "project_name": "PrintNexx",
    "documentation": "<h3>Overview</h3>\n<p>PrintNexx is an internal production system in active daily use. It solves real-world bottlenecks in photo preparation, portrait aspect-ratio finishing, background segmentation, and mass ID card rendering.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Architectural Highlights</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Automated Image Processing:</strong> OpenCV pipelines automatically detect faces, crop portraits to official ID ratios, and balance contrast.</li>\n  <li><strong>Batch Finishing Workflow:</strong> Converts thousands of raw submissions into calibrated CMYK/RGB color profiles ready for industrial thermal card printers.</li>\n  <li><strong>Zero-Downtime Operations:</strong> Packaged as a performant desktop and local server tool providing seamless daily throughput.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Technical Stack</h3>\n<p>Python, OpenCV, Image Processing, PIL, Automation Pipelines.</p>",
    "category": 21,
    "technologies": "Python, OpenCV, Image Processing, Automation",
