    "project_name": "EazeTrip",
    "documentation": "<h3>Overview</h3>\n<p>EazeTrip is a commercial travel operations platform custom-built for a tour agency to manage itineraries, live bookings, customer inquiries, and payment collections in real time.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Architectural Highlights</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Booking & Customer Management:</strong> Real-time reservation calendar with automated booking confirmations and invoice generation.</li>\n  <li><strong>Dynamic Pricing Engine:</strong> Configurable seasonal rate rules, discount vouchers, and passenger group calculations.</li>\n  <li><strong>Secure REST API:</strong> Integrated with third-party payment gateways and transactional SMS/Email notifications.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Technical Stack</h3>\n<p>Django, React, PostgreSQL, REST API, AI, Tailwind CSS.</p>",
